WEBVTT

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:03.837
Hi!

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:05.572
I'm Muhammad Husain Aboutalebi,

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.741
a multidisciplinary engineer

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:10.510
specializing in full-stack software development,

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.278
mechanical engineering,

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.514
and artificial intelligence.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.615
In this video,

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:20.186
I give a brief overview of the Omnia mobile application I developed.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:22.922
When building an end-to-end ecosystem,

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:27.927
security and a seamless onboarding experience are where it all begins.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:31.197
Here, I implemented robust user authentication,

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:33.066
secure phone verification,

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:35.201
and strict session management

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:39.272
to ensure a reliable entry point for every user.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.608
From an architectural standpoint,

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:45.945
scalability and user-centric design drive every decision.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:50.316
I designed dynamic user preference systems and customized profiles

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.319
that allow the application to adapt fluidly

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:54.821
to individual learning paths,

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:56.623
bridging complex backend logic

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:58.892
with an intuitive frontend interface.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:01.694
A truly production-grade application requires

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:04.664
comprehensive state management and resource tracking.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:07.967
This includes managing persistent conversational memory,

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.969
handling secure data updates,

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:13.640
and integrating real-time credit-based wallet transactions

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:17.444
—demonstrating a complete handle on business logic and state flow.

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:20.980
Bridging technical execution with real-world product value,

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:25.552
I built flexible subscription models and seamless billing options,

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:30.457
proving my capability to deliver software ready for commercial deployment.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:12.599
At the heart of the platform is real-time AI integration.

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:16.469
Whether it's processing instant bilingual translations,

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:18.671
rendering dynamic suggestion chips,

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:23.610
or capturing and visualizing audio waveforms for voice interactions,

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:32.118
this project showcases my dedication to crafting immersive, responsive, and end-to-end client experiences.